From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:33:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 29/32] node: pin self-hosted runtime to 26.13.0

Select Node.js 26.13.0, the Lithium LTS release, for repository tooling,
self-hosted backend and dashboard images, SDK CI, and the development
container. Refresh Node-only mise download metadata and Node type packages.

The local executor selects node from PATH and requires major 26. Residents
inherit that deployment-wide executable; no per-application runtime selector
is added. Install libatomic1 explicitly in the final backend image, which
copies the Node binary without its package dependency metadata.

Keep operator adoption and rollback guidance aligned with the exact pin.
Node 26 source-package metadata support remains a separate small patch so
upstream adoption can replace it independently.
---
